      value: "`uint32`\n\n---\n\n**Built-in Type**\n\nA 32-bit unsigned integer using variable-length encoding.\n\n**Details:**\n\n- **Wire format**: Variable-length value (`varint`).\n- **Range**: `0` to `4,294,967,295` inclusive.\n- **Go type**: `uint32`\n- **C++ type**: `uint32_t`\n- **Rust type**: `u32`\n"
