      kind: markdown
      value: "`bool`\n\n---\n\n**Built-in Type**\n\nA boolean value which can be either `true` or `false`.\n\n**Details:**\n\n- **Wire format**: Encoded as a `varint`.\n- **Value mapping**: `0` decodes to `false`, and `1` decodes to `true` (any non-zero varint value decodes to `true`).\n- **Go type**: `bool`\n- **C++ type**: `bool`\n- **Rust type**: `bool`\n"
